commit 4ba589d90b6303d0c3e28e4785b4d171576f9b4a
Author: Van Tran <940988+vantt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sat Sep 5 03:00:18 2026 +0700

    fix(mdview): resolve short links on demand before the index catches up
    
    `view_file` hands out a `/s/<code>` derived from the path hash without
    indexing anything, so a click before the background refresh or watcher
    caught up missed the hash lookup and 404ed while the long `/p/...` URL
